<title>UK: DB Capital Markets sets warrants on DAX Index. [CORRECTED 11:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>DB Capital Markets sets warrants on DAX Index. [CORRECTED 11:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to state that warrants are set on DAX, not Deutsche Bank).</p>
<p>DB Capital Markets has issued 10 million American-style put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the DAX index, lead manager Deutsche Bank AG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   10.DEC.96	    LISTING   FFURT, DUSS</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  2894 DEM	     MIN SUB   100</p>
<p> * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE    STRIKE	   MATURITY	 ISSUE</p>
<p> PUT     2900 DEM	 19.DEC.97	1.54 DEM</p>
<p> PUT     2900 DEM	 13.MAR.98	1.59 DEM</p>
<p> PUT     3000 DEM	 19.DEC.97	2.02 DEM</p>
<p> PUT     3000 DEM	 13.MAR.98	2.13 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
